Expose the connector ELD through the HDMI codec so ALSA uses the sink's actual
channel constraints instead of probing unsupported layouts. Clear the ELD
after unplug and always disable the DPTX audio block during shutdown.

Program the DisplayPort Audio InfoFrame supplied by the HDMI codec. Include
its CEA channel allocation and preserve it across link reconfiguration.

